BO_ 996 VIN_Broadcast: 8 Vector__XXX
 SG_ DATA : 0|64@1+ (1,0) [0|0] "" Vector__XXX

CM_ BO_ 996 "0x3E4. FORMERLY modelled as a multiplexed VIN broadcast (VIN_Frame mux 42/74/106 with VIN_C01..C17, plus a comment claiming VIN[1-7]=KMHKR81, VIN[8-14]=CPNU058, VIN[15-17]=627). That structure does not appear in any capture and has been removed - this frame carries no VIN signals. Every Ioniq 5 capture on disk (1013 frames across M-CAN and I-CAN) and every Ioniq 6 capture (379 frames) carries the constant payload FE 00 00 00 00 00 00 00, whose byte 0 = 0xFE is not one of the three multiplexer keys. ev6_HU_dump/HKMC_Consolidated_CAN_Master_Map.csv assigns 0x3E4 to the Gen-2A message BMS84 (Tx=BMS), and no in-repo official DBC (dbcs/dbcs/) defines a VIN broadcast here, so the frame name VIN_Broadcast is itself unsubstantiated - it is kept only so the id stays covered.";

CM_ BO_ 199 "Low level BMU control (0x0C7). Every command is 3 frames at 25 Hz followed by a 3-frame commit. Utility mode: D3=80 E0 07 then D3=00 E0 07. Conditioning mode enable: D4=F0 07 then D4=E0 07; disable: D4=E8 07 then D4=E0 07 (conditioning_mode_check.md, utility_mode.md). Preconditioning start: D4=40 03 then D4=E0 07; stop: D4=00 00 then D4=E0 07. A D4=10 00 pair also enabled conditioning mode in the 2026-09-07 MITM capture but is undocumented.";
CM_ SG_ 199 Utility_Mode "byte 2 (D3): 0x80 = utility-mode request (paired with D4=E0 D5=07); 0x00 = commit phase / not utility mode";
CM_ SG_ 199 Battery_Preconditioning_0 "byte 3 (D4) opcode: 0x00 stop phase 1, 0x10 undocumented conditioning-mode enable, 0x40 preconditioning start, 0xE0 command trailer, 0xE8 conditioning-mode disable, 0xF0 conditioning-mode enable";
CM_ SG_ 199 Battery_Preconditioning_1 "byte 4 (D5) operand: 0x00 with D4=00/10, 0x03 preconditioning start, 0x07 utility mode / conditioning enable / disable and the 0xE0 command trailer";
CM_ BO_ 685 "BMS_Precond_Status (0x2AD), Ioniq 5 / EV6. Byte 1 state: Ioniq 5 0x01 idle / 0x05 starting / 0x15 started; EV6 0x41 / 0x45 / 0x55. Ioniq 6 uses the extended ID 0x0A82AA03 instead.";
CM_ BO_ 1261 "Navigation_Precond_Status (0x4ED): navigation distance to charger and precondition flag.";
CM_ BO_ 1096 "Steering-wheel buttons (0x448): star, mode, speak, call, volume, skip, OK buttons.";

